d 'CTOOLS': module to provide C-accelerated tools 
d
d  ctools provides high-performance C plugins for Stata that
d dramatically	accelerate common data operations through
d parallelization and optimized  algorithms. 
d
d KW: levels
d KW: collapse
d KW: contract
d KW: egen
d KW: sort
d KW: factor variables
d
d Requires: Stata version 14.1
d
d Distribution-Date: 20241104
d
d Author: Michael Droste,  droste@usc.edu
d Support: email University of Southern California
d
